d align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">NA</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">0</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">No. of men aged 45&#x02013;84 years after stratified sampling</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1418</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">563</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">855</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1788</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">663</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1125</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td colspan="7" align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Reasons for exclusion from data analysis after data collection from general practices</italic></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;Men's records not available due to death or no longer registered at practice</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">194</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">48</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">146</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">141</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">56</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">85</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>No. of men aged 45&#x02013;84 years alive and still registered at practice</italic></td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1224</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">515</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">709</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1647</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">607</